<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ReservasBot — Acceso</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background: #030308; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
      min-height: 100vh; display: flex; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .orb {
      position: fixed; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(120px); pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;
    }
    .orb-1 { width: 700px; height: 700px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(124,58,237,0.14) 0%, transparent 70%); top: -200px; left: -150px; animation: d1 22s ease-in-out infinite; }
    .orb-2 { width: 500px; height: 500px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(79,70,229,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%); bottom: -100px; right: -100px; animation: d2 28s ease-in-out infinite; }
    @keyframes d1 { 0%,100%{transform:translate(0,0)} 50%{transform:translate(50px,40px)} }
    @keyframes d2 { 0%,100%{transform:translate(0,0)} 50%{transform:translate(-40px,-30px)} }

    /* LEFT */
    .left {
      flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
      padding: 60px 80px; position: relative; z-index: 1;
    }
    .logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 80px; }
    .logo-mark {
      width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6366f1);
      border-radius: 11px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 18px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(139,92,246,0.5);
    }
    .logo-name { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.4px; }

    .hero-tag {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      background: rgba(139,92,246,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.25);
      border-radius: 20px; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
      color: #c4b5fd; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .hero-tag::before { content:''; width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:#8b5cf6; box-shadow:0 0 8px #8b5cf6; }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: 52px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -2px; line-height: 1.05;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .hero-title em {
      font-style: normal;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c4b5fd 30%, #818cf8 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;
    }
    .hero-sub {
      font-size: 16px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); line-height: 1.65;
      max-width: 400px; margin-bottom: 52px; font-weight: 400;
    }

    .features { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
    .feat {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 14px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    }
    .feat-check {
      width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 6px; flex-shrink: 0;
      background: rgba(139,92,246,0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.3);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 10px; color: #c4b5fd;
    }

    /* RIGHT */
    .right {
      width: 480px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: 40px; position: relative; z-index: 1;
      border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.015);
      backdrop-filter: blur(40px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(40px);
    }

    .form-box { width: 100%; max-width: 360px; }
    .form-heading { margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .form-heading h2 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.8px; }
    .form-heading p { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); margin-top: 6px; }

    .err-box {
      background: rgba(239,68,68,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.2);
      color: #fca5a5; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .field { margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .field label { display: block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .field input {
      width: 100%; padding: 12px 15px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      border-radius: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
      outline: none; font-family: inherit; transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .field input:focus { border-color: rgba(139,92,246,0.6); background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }
    .field input::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.18); }

    .submit-btn {
      width: 100%; padding: 14px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6366f1);
      border: none; border-radius: 12px; color: #fff; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; letter-spacing: -0.2px; margin-top: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(139,92,246,0.4);
      transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
    }
    .submit-btn:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(139,92,246,0.6); transform: translateY(-1px); }

    .form-footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }
    .form-footer a { color: #c4b5fd; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
    .form-footer a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    @media (max-width: 768px) { .left { display: none; } .right { width: 100%; border-left: none; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="orb orb-1"></div>
  <div class="orb orb-2"></div>

  <div class="left">
    <div class="logo">
      <div class="logo-mark">🤖</div>
      <span class="logo-name">ReservasBot</span>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-tag">Plataforma de reservas IA</div>
    <div class="hero-title">Tu restaurante,<br><em>siempre activo</em></div>
    <div class="hero-sub">Inteligencia artificial que gestiona llamadas, WhatsApp y reservas 24/7. Sin perder ni una.</div>

    <div class="features">
      <div class="feat"><div class="feat-check">✓</div> Atiende llamadas automáticamente</div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="feat-check">✓</div> Gestiona WhatsApp con IA conversacional</div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="feat-check">✓</div> Lista de espera y recordatorios</div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="feat-check">✓</div> Panel de control en tiempo real</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="right">
    <div class="form-box">
      <div class="form-heading">
        <h2>Bienvenido</h2>
        <p>Accede a tu panel de reservas</p>
      </div>
      <% if (error) { %>
        <div class="err-box"><%= error %></div>
      <% } %>
      <form method="POST" action="/login">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Email</label>
          <input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="tu@restaurante.com" autofocus>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Contraseña</label>
          <input type="password" name="password" required placeholder="••••••••">
        </div>
        <button class="submit-btn" type="submit">Acceder →</button>
      </form>
      <div class="form-footer">¿Sin cuenta? <a href="/registro">Regístrate gratis</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
